            "text": "Raster-boundary activation is the initial exhaustive seed because it has a finite positive/negative ownership matrix, a Chromium-backed stage oracle, mutation movement, focused tests, a visual fixture, and evidence on all supported platforms. Raster content geometry remains a separate partial family so this exact claim does not imply pixel-content parity.",
